msgid "How many threads compile PPU and SPU code with LLVM, as RPCS3's Max LLVM Compile Threads. Auto uses every core; fewer keeps a phone cooler and uses less memory while a game is compiled, and makes it take longer. On ARM CPUs with efficiency cores (most phones, some ARM laptops) the default leaves those out."
